# Content rules (details: docs/02-business-facts.md, docs/03-sites.md, docs/07-seo-rules.md)

- Facts (specs, addresses, phones, holidays, history) must match `docs/02-business-facts.md`. Do not invent specs, stock, machines, clients or certifications.
- Each site's copy is written for that site. Do not copy paragraphs, FAQs or blog posts from another site, even reworded lightly. Spec numbers may repeat; sentences may not.
- A unit site goes deep on its focus product (see `docs/03-sites.md`); other products get short cards only.
- Never offer discontinued products (wire mesh, crimped mesh, demister pads). Welded mesh only on the Shree Weld Mesh site.
- Four sites sell perforated sheets; each keeps its own angle (CNC patterns / Mumbai expanded + punching / mechanical punching in bulk / ready stock). See the table in `docs/03-sites.md`.
- Canonical URLs use the site's own `config.origin`. Never point a canonical at another site.
- Unit sites show "A Jai Shree Group company" and link once to the main site; no cross-linking blocks between all sites.
- Write plainly: short sentences, specific numbers and units, no hype words.
